{"id":"70f838ca7c11b06f","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-thm-sch.md","title":"Singular Cardinal Hypothesis","display":"thm-sch — Singular Cardinal Hypothesis","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-sch","aliases":["58-thm-sch","Singular Cardinal Hypothesis","SCH"],"display":"thm-sch — Singular Cardinal Hypothesis","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-singular-cardinal.md]]","[[58-df-gch.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-card6-successor-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-sch"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-sch</span><span>Singular Cardinal Hypothesis</span><span>SCH</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sch — Singular Cardinal Hypothesis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c7624782e2090b42\" href=\"?note=c7624782e2090b42\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-singular-cardinal.md\">../batch20/58-df-singular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f13d4bbe06c4eb5a\" href=\"?note=f13d4bbe06c4eb5a\" title=\"58-df-gch.md\">58-df-gch.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9d5d4277ed578b72\" href=\"?note=9d5d4277ed578b72\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-card6-successor-cardinal.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-card6-successor-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SCH}\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{SCH}\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SingularCardinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{SingularCardinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c7624782e2090b42\" href=\"?note=c7624782e2090b42\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-singular-cardinal.md\">../batch20/58-df-singular-cardinal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\kappa,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard6SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\kappa,\\mu)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9d5d4277ed578b72\" href=\"?note=9d5d4277ed578b72\" title=\"58-df-zfc-card6-successor-cardinal.md\">58-df-zfc-card6-successor-cardinal.md</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"58-df-powerset.md\">58-df-powerset.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sch}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SCH}\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\kappa\\in V\\;\n\\left[\n\\left(\\operatorname{SingularCardinal}(\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\bigl(|\\mathcal P(\\lambda)|&lt;\\kappa\\bigr)\\right)\n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcCard6SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\kappa,|\\mathcal P(\\kappa)|)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sch}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SCH}\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\kappa\\in V\\;\n\\left[\n\\left(\\operatorname{SingularCardinal}(\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\bigl(|\\mathcal P(\\lambda)|&lt;\\kappa\\bigr)\\right)\n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcCard6SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\kappa,|\\mathcal P(\\kappa)|)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Silver's theorem: breakthrough showing SCH partly provable.</li>\n<li>SCH is the &quot;right&quot; generalization of GCH to singular cardinals.</li>\n<li>GCH implies SCH.</li>\n<li>SCH is independent of ZFC (relative to suitable large-cardinal consistency assumptions for failures).</li>\n<li>If <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> has uncountable cofinality and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\alpha=\\alpha^+\">\\(2^\\alpha=\\alpha^+\\)</span> for all <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\">\\(\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\)</span>, then Silver's theorem yields <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\kappa=\\kappa^+\">\\(2^\\kappa=\\kappa^+\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Independence requires large cardinals (measurable+).</li>\n<li>Shelah's PCF theory: deep analysis of cardinal arithmetic.</li>\n<li>The predicate name now matches the one exported by the singular-cardinal definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-singular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"c7624782e2090b42","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-singular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-gch.md","status":"resolved","id":"f13d4bbe06c4eb5a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-gch.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-card6-successor-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"9d5d4277ed578b72","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-card6-successor-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-singular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"c7624782e2090b42","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SingularCardinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch20/58-df-singular-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的最小等势序数，使用 [[58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-card6-successor-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"9d5d4277ed578b72","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","exce